  instruction: Listen and choose the meaning.
  audioClip: {fileID: 0}
  spokenText: "Zmija boa pr\u011Bgoltaje svoju \u017Ertvu v c\u011Blosti, bez \u017Euvanja."
  options:
  - The book was called True Stories from Nature.
  - After that it cannot move.
  - I once saw a magnificent picture in a book.
  - Boa constrictors swallow their prey whole, without chewing it.
